      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::web::021::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boron incorporation increases chemical disorder and alters local bonding.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boron-induced chemical disorder and local bonding changes hinder atomic diffusion and nucleation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boron is smaller than the atoms it replaces and forms strong covalent-like bonds in the proposed alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The size and bonding characteristics of boron disrupt regular atomic arrangements.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "This structural disruption reduces atomic mobility during cooling and reheating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduced atomic mobility enhances amorphous-phase retention and suppresses crystallization relative to the phosphorus-only alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The boron-substituted alloy will retain more amorphous material after rapid cooling than Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The boron-substituted alloy will exhibit delayed or reduced crystallization during reheating relative to Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cooling rate significantly affects the microstructure and phase composition of Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20.",
      "field": "baseline",
