        "PMC11642357::web::021::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slower cooling produces more complex, multiphase crystalline structures than faster cooling in Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20.",
